{"headword":"פָּשָׂה","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb. spread</strong>, intrans. <strong>(</strong>NH <span dir=\"rtl\">פָּסָה</span> id.<em>;</em> Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">فَشَا (فشو)</span> <em>be divulged, spread, be extensive</em><strong>)</strong>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">פ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:5\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.5\">Lv 13:5</a> +, 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">פָּֽשְׂתָה</span> v <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:8\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.8\">8</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">פָּשָׂ֑תָה</span> v <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:23\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.23\">23</a>; Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִפְשֶׂה</span> v <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:35\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.35\">35</a>, 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּפְשֶׂה</span> v <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:7\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.7\">7</a> +; Inf. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">פָּשׂה</span> v <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:7\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.7\">7</a> +;—only <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13\" href=\"/Leviticus.13\">Lv 13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14\" href=\"/Leviticus.14\">14</a>, of leprosy and like eruptions: c. <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּעוֹר</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּבֶּגֶד</span>, etc., <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:5\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.5\">Lv 13:5</a> + 7 times <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.13\">13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:39\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.39\">14:39</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:44\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.44\">44</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:48\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.48\">48</a> + <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּעוֹר פָּשׂה יִפְשֶׂה (תִּפ׳)</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:7\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.7\">13:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:22\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.22\">22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:27\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.27\">27</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:35\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.35\">35</a>; abs. v <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:23\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.23\">23</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:32\" href=\"